                                                "sense_id": "05190f30-7660-39cc-bdc8-8a13c0f3bbe8",
                                                "text": "Organic sales, which exclude the impact of acquisitions, divestitures and foreign exchange, are now expected to rise 2 per cent to 5 per cent[…]."
